# Proposal only. All lines are comments; do not install as an active source.
# Intended distinct source identity: PUSB (USB source), retaining PTOB (GPIO).
# A future source could use chrony's SOCK refclock at /run/ptob-usb/chrony.sock:
# refclock SOCK /run/ptob-usb/chrony.sock refid PUSB noselect
# No emitter exists in this prototype. Unknown uncertainty cannot be replaced
# by an invented precision value. A separate controlled promotion requires a
# validated causal frame/host association, original source/map/deadline fences,
# measured host-clock bounds, source-cohort comparison and intentional GPIO/USB
# selection policy. Keep the existing chronyd as the sole system-clock writer.
